5. Recommendations
Based on expected project requirements:
Scenario	Recommended Approach
Small dataset (< 500 invoices)	Few-shot Prompting
Medium dataset (500–5000 invoices)	RAG + Chain-of-Thought
Large dataset (> 5000 invoices)	Fine-tuning + Retrieval Augmented System
Highly critical predictions	Add Self-Consistency + Manual Review
